# Environment of the databastion-agent service (systemd EnvironmentFile), KEY=value lines.
# Read by systemd as root before the privileges are dropped: keep this file 0600 root:root.
# Prefer `secret: {file: ...}` in agent.yaml for target passwords (deploy/README.md).
#
# HTTPS_PROXY=http://proxy.example.internal:3128
# NO_PROXY=db1.internal,127.0.0.1
# DATABASTION_LOG=info
